<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: REUTER - HARVEST CONSENSUS ESTIMATES UP TO DEC 6.</title>
<headline>REUTER - HARVEST CONSENSUS ESTIMATES UP TO DEC 6.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are key exchange, interest rate and macro-economic estimates for 1996 prepared by Harvest Financial services and distributed to subscribers of Reuters Irish News Service.</p>
<p>Harvest said the estimates were compiled from Ireland's &quot;top ten banking and stockbroking institutions&quot;.</p>
<p>The estimates will be updated every fortnight.</p>
